     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">so, in retrospect, this was sort of a stupid question to post as it was only matter of breaking the df on the left side of the join into pieces.  For completeness, here&#39;s the function I wrote, with maybe the ugliest loop of all time (i&#39;d love to hear an improvement).  It wouldn&#39;t work for most of the other join types, however.<div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">build_the_left</span><span style=\"color:#000\">_join </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> df2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  breaks </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">from</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> to </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  b1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> breaks</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">breaks</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  b2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> breaks</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">breaks</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NULL<br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">b1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> left_join</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> slice</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">b1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">b2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> df2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bind_rows</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>y<br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div></div></div>"
